WEBVTT

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:42.470
By the orders of the new Queen Seimiya, Erin, Lilan, Owl, and Eku had left Kazalm

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:47.070
and were being relocated to the Lazal Beast-Lord Care Center in the capital.

00:01:57.740 --> 00:02:01.440
<i>I'm being sent to the Lazal Beast-Lord Care Center as well.</i>

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:02.690
<i>I see.</i>

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:07.110
<i>The palace has great expectations of you.</i>

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:16.430
<i>If you obey Damiya-sama's orders, you'll gain some measure of freedom.</i>

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:21.440
<i>I want to allow the beasts that were born in the wild to live as though they're in the wild.</i>

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:23.880
<i>I've always hoped for that.</i>

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:27.850
<i>That's why I've never used benetrophic water or the mute whistle.</i>

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:32.170
<i>But right now, I can't do anything for them.</i>

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:36.260
<i>Moreover, I'm taking away their freedom.</i>

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:40.150
<i>People are powerless.</i>

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:44.620
<i>It's not a sin to live abiding by your fate.</i>

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:49.020
<i>How I was able to connect with Lilan...</i>

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:53.140
<i>How I enabled her to fly the sky like a wild beast-lord would...</i>

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:55.960
<i>How I promoted her ability to have a baby...</i>

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:57.990
<i>Were all of those mistakes?!</i>

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.220
<i>Erin...</i>

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:01.800
<i>I-</i>

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:10.550
<i>Why are you carrying a dagger like that?</i>

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:16.750
<i>You're not planning to die, are y-</i>

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.270
<i>If a catastrophe is to befall us because of my actions,</i>

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:22.510
<i>then I will take responsibility before that happens.</i>

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:31.510
<i>I was ready for this to come any day now, Onii-sama.</i>

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:34.710
<i>I wish you the best, Onii-sama.</i>

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:39.900
<i>Tahya, Tahya!</i>

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:56.300
Akun me Chai

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:01.300
Ake Village

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:11.210
Everyone!  The Grand Duke says there'll be a war soon!

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:13.600
Make sure the Touda and Kiba are in top shape!

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:19.590
He's acting like the Chief since Hasson-san's bedridden.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:22.380
Chok, did you say something?

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:26.070
No, nothing.

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:42.130
You can't.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:53.060
Mom, there's a proper cemetery at the village, so why is there a grave here?

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:56.000
Is it because they're an Akun Me Chai?

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.780
Who did you learn that from?

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:02.320
Wadan-san was saying it.

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.600
Akun... Me Chai...

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:09.520
Don't call her that.

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:15.470
The one resting here is Mom's childhood friend.

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.390
Ah, so this is where you were.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.860
Dad!

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:37.810
We've brought Erin-dono.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.250
Enter.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:44.230
Well done.

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:46.130
You may leave.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:47.310
Yes, sir.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:56.890
I heard the story.  How's your wound doing?

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:59.350
It doesn't hurt much anymore.

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:04.960
What a fearful accident that was.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:13.270
But I hear that you still haven't given into that fear and still control the beast-lords without use of the mute whistle.

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:19.200
The friendship that Lilan and I used to have no longer exists.

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:25.290
Even so, I'm told that they obey your words.

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:28.740
What's important is that fact.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:31.700
I'm jealous of you for having an obedient servant.

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:37.600
Come, have a seat over here.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:47.190
Have you been informed that the Grand Duke's son came to visit the palace?

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:48.460
No.

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:50.940
He's called Shunan.

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:56.410
He has no sense of his position and asked the Queen to marry him.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:02.270
He's demanding that the Queen confront an army of Touda at Tahai Aze

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:07.230
in order to reenact the miracle that was the advent of the Founding Queen.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:12.720
He claims that he'll have the Queen devoured when that miracle doesn't come to pass.

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:17.620
He's charged her to become his wife if she doesn't want that.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:24.160
However, just as this situation arose, you've come.

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:28.050
Wouldn't you agree that gods have the best roll of the dice?

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:34.700
Damiya-sama, what would you have me do?

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:39.830
I want you to create an army of beast-lords.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:43.040
An army of beast-lords?

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:47.920
A resilient army bent by your personal instruction.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:11.320
You saw how the beast-lord ate the Touda, did you not?

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:18.200
What I desire is that magnificent display of strength.

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:25.460
The Grand Duke's army of Touda pit against the Queen's army of beast-lords...

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:28.820
It would be an amazing balance, don't you think?

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:32.240
Mom.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.710
What kind of girl was Erin-chan?

00:08:35.670 --> 00:08:41.050
Very courageous, knowledgeable, and always had a wonderful smile.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:48.050
I still can't believe that Erin-chan died.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:08.110
The distortion in this country began as a result of the forces becoming unbalanced.

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:13.460
These two, the Grand Duke's military power, and our own authority...

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:17.720
because they do not balance,

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:22.500
one side will be crushed and soon fall apart.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:29.980
By creating an army of beast-lords,

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:34.760
my only interest is to return that balance.

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:49.160
If we have an army of beast-lords, we will gain the power to hold back the Grand Duke.

00:09:49.510 --> 00:09:55.630
When that happens, there would be no need for a civil war.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:10:00.030
Well?  Do you have a better idea than this?

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:11.860
King Oharon, who was exiled from his country, used beast-lords, causing the decline of the Oharon Kingdom.

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:18.660
The <i>Beast-Lord Imperatives</i> were written to help avoid that same catastrophe.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:25.330
But now, I'm being taken advantage of to reenact the advent of the Founding Queen.

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:40.000
Luke!

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:41.840
Lilan!

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:48.370
What must I do?

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:52.480
You will do this for me, won't you, daughter of Arryo?

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:06.180
It's impossible to form an army of beast-lords.

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:07.660
"Impossible?"

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:12.370
I'm the only one who can control the beast-lords.

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:16.360
Are you familiar with the phrase Akun Me Chai, Damiya-sama?

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:18.920
"Akun Me Chai?"

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:23.090
It's the words for "a child born from an impossible joining."

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:25.580
My mother was of the Mist People.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.350
My father was a Touda breeder.

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:35.060
As you know, these two do not cross paths in their daily routines.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:45.070
But due to a chance meeting, my mother and father were attracted to one another, married, and had me.

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:49.740
Mist People are said to have special powers,

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:56.070
but as an Akun Me Chai, I have them, also.

00:11:56.070 --> 00:12:03.320
So you're telling me that you can control the beast-lords because you're an Akun Me Chai?

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.160
Yes.

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:08.670
Ridiculous!

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:12.010
You're expecting me to believe that?

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:15.590
If you doubt me, then I will prove it to you.

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:18.340
"Prove?"

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:26.570
Erin knew better than anyone else that neither the Mist People nor Akun Me Chai had any special powers.

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:38.070
But to avoid beast-lords being used in war, Erin attempted to use this misconception about the Mist People to her advantage.

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:57.440
Lazal Beast-Lord Care Center

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:20.080
She's a strange woman.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:24.210
She stayed with the beast-lords all night long.

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:33.250
Are you ready?

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:35.350
Yes.

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.160
I see.

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:42.900
Then let's have you prove this power of the Akun Me Chai you spoke of.

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:45.770
Most certainly.

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:56.040
I will now show how to control the beast-lords.

00:13:56.040 --> 00:14:03.750
If simply anyone can control them, then all it should take is to make the same tune I do.

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:06.500
Would you like to give it a try?

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:13.270
You don't have to, you know?

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:18.520
No!  I am the one most experienced in handling the beast-lords here at Lazal.

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:22.730
I would like to nominate myself to take on the role.

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:31.110
Let's have you try it with the largest beast-lord.

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:05.710
For a second, the fear from when she was attacked by Lilan came back to her.

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:11.960
But Erin placed the fear deep inside and played her harp.

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:44.320
How?

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:47.480
How can a beast-lord be calmed with a harp like that?

00:15:54.610 --> 00:16:02.190
Erin taught Ouri how to play the harp until he was able to play the tune exactly as she herself did.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:09.200
You're aware of how large a beast-lord's personal space is, right?

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:13.400
When you sense danger, please don't hesitate to run.

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:16.670
I will be behind you with the mute whistle.

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:18.480
Okay!

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:02.510
Why isn't it listening to me?

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.880
Are you all right?

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:35.530
Y-Yeah...

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.870
Akun Me Chai, eh?

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:53.360
Do you understand my point now?

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:58.820
Still, I haven't given up on the army of beast-lords.

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:07.580
For example, the result may differ if we raise them the way you did.

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:14.880
But then, it takes years to prove that.

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:19.800
Right now, you're the only one who can control the beast-lords.

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:26.140
I will have you ride on the back of a beast-lord to depict a miracle at Tahai Aze.

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:34.590
But if I flew on Lilan to protect the Queen, is the Grand Duke foolish enough to believe that to be a miracle?

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:42.310
The plague upon this country is not something that will go away with one miracle.

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:44.880
You're a smart girl.

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:47.990
But once is enough.

00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:52.570
The Grand Duke's son has made a proclamation before Seimiya.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:19:01.760
If a miracle occurs as the legend says, where a beast-lord bows down to her, descending to save her,

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:06.040
then he will pledge eternal loyalty to her as her subject.

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:09.840
Shunan is an earnest man.

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:12.520
He wouldn't go back on his word.

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:18.480
What if I say I won't accept this, regardless?

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:24.450
I will drop you down to Hikara, alive.

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:31.910
Plus, Kazalm Academy is already within my grasp.

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:42.020
What are you going to do with Esal-sensei and the students?!

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:44.050
It all depends on your answer.

00:19:46.270 --> 00:19:47.420
This is dirty.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.810
You're a rotten man.

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:52.920
It is my duty to take on the dirty role.

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:58.270
If this isn't enough, I can go capture the girl you think of as your best friend.

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:00.270
Yuuyan was her name, was it not?

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:06.770
I wonder how you'll feel as you watch them being executed.

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:12.200
This time, I will not permit you audience with the Queen.

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:15.600
There's no one who will protect you.

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:17.670
Think this through carefully.

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:25.920
You bringing the miracle to pass will not only save the teachers and your friends, but yourself, too.

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:32.260
Do you not understand?

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:36.090
When the Grand Duke, who is a master of Touda, becomes the King of this country,

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:39.260
the skills to control the beast-lords will be sealed away.

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:45.970
"When the Grand Duke becomes the King of this country..."

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:51.370
And as for you, as an Akun Me Chai, you'll probably be sent to death as well.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:21:01.170
For you and the beast-lords to live peacefully, the Queen must remain the ruler of this country.

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:06.690
<i>When the Grand Duke, who is a master of Touda, becomes the King of this country,</i>

00:21:06.690 --> 00:21:10.100
<i>the skills to control the beast-lords will be sealed away.</i>

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:13.770
Be sure to remember that sharply.

00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:20.150
"The skills to control the beast-lords will be sealed away."

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:51.400
"The skills to control the beast-lords...

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:56.560
will be sealed away."

00:22:03.570 --> 00:22:09.550
With these words from Damiya, Erin realized an entirely new possibility.

00:22:10.570 --> 00:22:17.240
If the Grand Duke were to become the King, the beast-lords would not be used as weapons of war.

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:26.120
It seemed like a sliver of light shining upon the path that would lead to saving Lilan and her family.

00:24:02.470 --> 00:24:08.890
Ial, did you know that we Sezans were relieved from guarding Seimiya-sama?

00:24:08.890 --> 00:24:16.230
That's not all.  Men we don't recognize have been appointed as new Sezans in the palace.

00:24:16.230 --> 00:24:21.860
You're actually going to respond to
his summons in this situation?

00:24:21.860 --> 00:24:25.010
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Bird in a Cage.

00:24:25.010 --> 00:26:00.030
Bird in a Cage
